pe\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Use existing locations, employ internal spokespeople, and keep shoots to 1–2 days. Also, start with one flagship video and repurpose it across channels instead of producing many separate videos. Working with an experienced agency also prevents costly reshoots and revisions.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do we measure the success of a business video?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Track completion rate (how far viewers watch), click-through rate (links clicked from the video), and conversion rate (leads or sales generated). Compare performance across platforms. Long-term, monitor brand lift and employee engagement. Strong production partners help you set KPIs before filming starts.\"}}]}]}"}></script>
